abstract: >-
  Reproducibility code and experimental results supporting the study
  "Label-Induced Bias and Verification-Cost Trade-offs in Federated Learning:
  A Budget-Constrained Crowd-Intelligence Approach." The repository contains
  federated learning experiments under IID and non-IID partitioning, synthetic
  training-label corruption, and budget-constrained simulated verification.
